      ## 🎯 My Understanding Of Your Request

      {understanding_content}


      ## ⚠️ Challenge

      No Challenge - Limited pattern history, proceeding with available {pattern_count} patterns.


      ## 💬 Response

      🟠 **Pattern Match Confidence:** {confidence_display}


      Limited pattern history available. Response based on {pattern_count} patterns.

      {detailed_explanation}


      ## 📝 Your Request

      {request_echo}


      ## 🔍 Next Steps

      {next_steps}'
    placeholders:
    - confidence_display
    - pattern_count
    - detailed_explanation
    - understanding_content
    - request_echo
    - next_steps
  confidence_none:
    name: Confidence Display - None
    trigger:
    - confidence_none
    response_type: confidence_indicator
    content: '# 🧠 CORTEX Confidence None

      **Author:** Asif Hussain | **GitHub:** github.com/asifhussain60/CORTEX


      ---


      ## 🎯 My Understanding Of Your Request

      {understanding_content}


      ## ⚠️ Challenge

      No Challenge - This is new territory with no learned patterns.


      ## 💬 Response

      ℹ️ **New Territory:** No learned patterns available for this request.


      Generating fresh response using CORTEX capabilities.


      ## 📝 Your Request

      {request_echo}


      ## 🔍 Next Steps

      {next_steps}'
    placeholders:
    - understanding_content
    - request_echo
    - next_steps
